prompts.prompt:
Create a 4-email follow-up sequence for a lead who {{lead_action}} (e.g., downloaded a guide, requested a demo, visited pricing page).

Lead details:
- Name: {{lead_name}}
- Company: {{lead_company}}
- Source: {{lead_source}}
- Interest: {{lead_interest}}

## Email 1 (Same day): Thank you + value
## Email 2 (Day 3): Case study / social proof
## Email 3 (Day 7): Direct offer / call to action
## Email 4 (Day 14): Breakup / keep in touch

Each email: subject line, body (150-200 words), and CTA.
Tone: helpful consultant, not salesperson.
